@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080
# Login first, or use: go run ./cmd/token -email admin@example.com
@token = replace-me

### List accounts
GET {{host}}/api/admin/v1/accounts?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an account and get a one-time activation link
POST {{host}}/api/admin/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"editor@example.com","displayName":"Editor","roles":["editor"]}

### Roles and permissions
GET {{host}}/api/admin/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

GET {{host}}/api/admin/v1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
